## PRO TIPS & SHORTCUTS

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ILLUSTRATOR SHORTCUTS (WORK FASTER)                │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                      │
│  🎯 SELECTION & DRAWING:                            │
│  • V – Selection tool                              │
│  • A – Direct selection                            │
│  • P – Pen tool                                     │
│  • Shift+C – Anchor point tool                     │
│  • + (with Pen) – Add anchor point                 │
│  • - (with Pen) – Delete anchor point              │
│                                                      │
│  🔧 EDITING:                                        │
│  • Ctrl+D – Repeat last transform                  │
│  • Ctrl+G – Group                                   │
│  • Ctrl+Shift+G – Ungroup                          │
│  • Ctrl+8 – Make compound path                     │
│  • Ctrl+Alt+Shift+8 – Release compound path       │
│                                                      │
│  🎨 COLOR:                                          │
│  • X – Swap fill/stroke                            │
│  • D – Default colors (white fill, black stroke)  │
│  • Shift+X – Swap fill/stroke colors              │
│  • , (comma) – Color picker                        │
│                                                      │
│  🔥 PRO TIP: Use Ctrl+Y for outline mode          │
│  Great for checking anchor points                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

